# Source: Leave this on, otherwise bypassing several animations in a row may look broken.
classic.settings.cached_dispatch.alarm = 请保持开启，否则连续绕过多个动画时可能看起来不正常。
# Source: Gives each bypassed emote a target emote of its own. This is useful when you want to bypass multiple emotes quickly.\n\n"Off" would make it so other people on your sync service would see you redraw constantly.\n"Only when necessary" spreads emotes only after a game patch breaks the cache-breaker feature.\n"On" always spreads emotes.\n\nRecommended: "On" if you want other people on your sync service to always see you properly without redrawing all the time, otherwise highly recommended to leave it on "Only when necessary" and not "Off".
classic.settings.cached_dispatch.help = 为每个被绕过的情感动作分配一个专属的目标情感动作。当你想快速绕过多个情感动作时很有用。\n\n“关闭”会让同步服务中的其他人看到你不断重绘。\n“仅在必要时”只在游戏版本更新导致缓存破坏功能失效后才分散情感动作。\n“开启”始终分散情感动作。\n\n推荐：如果你希望同步服务中的其他人始终正确看到你、而不是一直重绘，请选“开启”；否则强烈建议保持“仅在必要时”，不要选“关闭”。
# Source: Applies the cache-break mechanism to every emote, even those you own. This is a bonus feature and is experimental. This will allow the client to always "refresh" animations so you never have to redraw yourself or stop emoting to apply an animation change.
classic.settings.cache_break.help = 对所有情感动作应用缓存破坏机制，包括你已拥有的。这是一个实验性的额外功能。它让客户端始终“刷新”动画，这样你就不必为了应用动画更改而重绘自己或停止情感动作。
# Source: Takes effect when "Spread swaps over several emote" is enabled. This determines which emotes become available for a source emote. Basically, if you want to spread swaps over 5 emotes, and you try to bypass an emote but you only have 2 same-rank targets available, this is how it will determine what to do in this scenario. A rank is basically a category of emotes with similar characteristics (same turn behaviour, etc).\n\n"Same rank only" strictly picks targets of the same rank.\n"One rank below" also accepts targets one rank below.\n"Anything allowed" picks any target it can find, regardless of the rank.\n\nNone of them ever breaks your other rules.\n\nRecommended: "One rank below", or "Same rank only" if you want behavior accuracy.
classic.settings.dispatch_fidelity.help = 在启用“将替换分散到多个情感动作”时生效。它决定一个源情感动作可以使用哪些情感动作。简单来说，如果你想把替换分散到 5 个情感动作上，而你尝试绕过某个情感动作时只有 2 个同等级目标可用，这个设置就决定此时该怎么做。等级大致是一类特征相近的情感动作（相同的转向行为等）。\n\n“仅限同一等级”严格只选同一等级的目标。\n“低一个等级”也接受低一个等级的目标。\n“任何都可以”会选择它能找到的任何目标，不论等级。\n\n它们都不会破坏你的其他规则。\n\n推荐：“低一个等级”，如果你想要行为准确，可选“仅限同一等级”。
# Source: How long the same error stays quiet after you have seen it.\n\nAccepts time format: 5m, 300s, 5m10s, 1h.\nSet to 0 to see every one of them.
classic.settings.error_throttle.help = 你看到某个错误后，同一错误保持静默的时长。\n\n可接受的时间格式：5m、300s、5m10s、1h。\n设为 0 则每次都显示。
