# Source: Enable Force Approval
classic.settings.gate.force_enable = 启用强制批准
# Source: Bypass Emote has not been approved for this game build.
classic.settings.gate.not_approved = Bypass Emote 尚未获准用于此游戏版本。
# Source: Emote swaps may behave oddly until the build is approved.\nThe plugin will automatically fetch updates every 10 minutes to check if it was approved.
classic.settings.gate.not_approved.text = 在该版本获得批准之前，情感动作替换可能表现异常。\n插件会每 10 分钟自动获取更新，检查是否已获批准。
# Source: Bypass Emote cannot be tested on this game client.
classic.settings.gate.untested = Bypass Emote 无法在此游戏客户端上测试。
# Source: Show windows in GPose
classic.settings.gpose = 在集体动作中显示窗口
# Source: Keeps this plugin's windows visible while you are in GPose.
classic.settings.gpose.help = 在集体动作中保持此插件的窗口可见。
# Source: Show windows while the game UI is hidden
classic.settings.hidden_ui = 隐藏游戏界面时显示窗口
# Source: Keeps this plugin's windows visible when you hide the game UI.
classic.settings.hidden_ui.help = 隐藏游戏界面时保持此插件的窗口可见。
# Source: When no unlocked looped emote fits as a target, your current idle pose may be eligible instead. The emote you try to bypass will then be targeted onto your current idle pose. This will cause a redraw of your character when triggered.\n\n"Never" blocks idle poses from being used as targets.\n"Only when nothing else fits" uses the pose only when literally no unlocked looped emote could have played here at all. This will not use your idle pose if any other emote would have been available if it wasn't blocked.\n"Allow" always falls back to your idle pose when no other options are available.\n\nRecommended: "Only when nothing else fits".
classic.settings.idle_pose_loops.help = 当没有合适的已解锁循环情感动作可作为目标时，你当前的待机姿势可能会作为替代。你尝试绕过的情感动作会被放到你当前的待机姿势上。触发时会导致你的角色重绘。\n\n“从不”禁止把待机姿势用作目标。\n“仅在没有其他合适选项时”只在确实没有任何已解锁的循环情感动作可以播放时才使用姿势。如果某个其他情感动作在未被屏蔽的情况下本可以使用，就不会使用你的待机姿势。\n“允许”在没有其他选项时始终退回到你的待机姿势。\n\n推荐：“仅在没有其他合适选项时”。
# Source: How many swaps are kept per target emote. 0 keeps them all.\n\nEach kept swap stays as an option of the generated Penumbra mod, so playing an emote again enables it again without rebuilding it. The only cost is that the mod gets bigger.
classic.settings.kept_swaps.help = 每个目标情感动作保留多少个替换。0 表示全部保留。\n\n每个保留的替换都会作为生成的 Penumbra 模组中的一个选项，因此再次播放情感动作时会直接重新启用，无需重建。唯一的代价是模组会变大。
# Source: Last resort
classic.settings.last_resort = 最后手段
# Source: Lenient
classic.settings.lenient = 宽松
# Source: When the emote ends
classic.settings.lifetime.ends = 情感动作结束时
# Source: "When the emote ends" puts your real emote back as soon as the animation stops.\n"When you play the target emote" keeps the swap enabled until the next time you play the target emote.\n"Never" keeps the swap live until another swap claims the same target emote.\n\nRecommended: "When you play the target emote". "When the emote ends" is not recommended, as people will see you redraw constantly after swapping.
classic.settings.lifetime.help = “情感动作结束时”在动画停止后立即恢复你真正的情感动作。\n“播放目标情感动作时”会保持替换，直到你下一次播放目标情感动作。\n“从不”会保持替换，直到另一个替换占用同一个目标情感动作。\n\n推荐：“播放目标情感动作时”。不推荐“情感动作结束时”，因为替换后别人会看到你不断重绘。
# Source: When you play the target emote
classic.settings.lifetime.target = 播放目标情感动作时
# Source: Show locked emotes in the game's Emote window
classic.settings.locked_in_window = 在游戏的情感动作窗口中显示未解锁的情感动作
# Source: "Strict" only puts a looping emote on another looping one.\n"Lenient" lets a looping emote play once on a one time emote when no better match exists.\n\nRecommended: "Strict", or "Lenient" if you really don't have many emotes.
classic.settings.loop_matching.help = “严格”只会把循环情感动作放到另一个循环情感动作上。\n“宽松”在没有更好的匹配时，允许循环情感动作在只播放一次的情感动作上播放一次。\n\n推荐：“严格”，如果你拥有的情感动作确实不多，可选“宽松”。
# Source: Determines whether to block unlocked emotes from being picked when they are modified by at least one of your mods. This prevents other people from seeing other modded emotes you might have before the swap takes place.\nAs an example, you have a mod on beesknees, and you try to bypass /conduct which happens to land on beesknees: other players might or might not see the modded beesknees for a moment.\n\n"Allowed" allows using unlocked emotes that are modified by one of your mods.\n"Last resort" uses one only when nothing else fits.\n"Blocked" never uses one, and show an error message in the chat with options to disable or open the mod in penumbra.\n\nRecommended: "Last resort", or "Blocked" if you absolutely don't want your modded emotes to accidentaly be seen.
classic.settings.modded_targets.help = 决定是否禁止选用被你至少一个模组修改过的已解锁情感动作。这可以防止在替换生效之前，其他人看到你可能拥有的其他模组情感动作。\n例如，你有一个修改 beesknees 的模组，当你尝试绕过 /conduct 而它恰好落在 beesknees 上时，其他玩家可能会短暂看到被修改的 beesknees。\n\n“允许”允许使用被你的模组修改过的已解锁情感动作。\n“最后手段”只在没有其他合适选项时才使用。\n“屏蔽”永远不使用，并在聊天中显示错误消息，提供停用模组或在 Penumbra 中打开模组的选项。\n\n推荐：“最后手段”，如果你绝对不希望模组情感动作被意外看到，可选“屏蔽”。
# Source: Never
classic.settings.never = 从不
# Source: Use the new interface
classic.settings.new_interface = 使用新界面
# Source: Switches back to the new interface.\nThe classic interface is the one you are looking at, exactly as in previous versions.
classic.settings.new_interface.help = 切换回新界面。\n你现在看到的就是经典界面，与以前的版本完全相同。
# Source: Only when nothing else fits
classic.settings.nothing_else_fits = 仅在没有其他合适选项时
# Source: Off
classic.settings.off = 关闭
# Source: On
classic.settings.on = 开启
# Source: One rank below
classic.settings.one_below = 低一个等级
# Source: Safe mode is not 100% guaranteed to be safe either. It prevents Direct Play from being used in states where it was proved to go wrong, but I can not prove the absence of issues. Use Emote Swap if you want to be 100% safe, it will behave almost the same way.
classic.settings.safe_mode_not_a_promise = 安全模式也不能保证 100% 安全。它会阻止在已被证实会出问题的状态下使用直接播放，但我无法证明不存在任何问题。如果你想要 100% 安全，请使用情感动作替换，它的表现几乎相同。
# Source: Same rank only
classic.settings.same_rank = 仅限同一等级
# Source: Windows
classic.settings.section.windows = 窗口
# Source: "Strict" never puts an emote on one that makes sound.\n"Lenient" allows matching emotes that make sounds together.\n"Off" will let emotes play regardless of sound.\n\nThis is to prevent vanilla people from seeing you play fume which could annoy other vanilla players, for example.\n\nRecommended: "Lenient".
classic.settings.sound_matching.help = “严格”永远不会把情感动作放到会发出声音的情感动作上。\n“宽松”允许把都会发出声音的情感动作相互匹配。\n“关闭”无论声音如何都会播放情感动作。\n\n这是为了避免原版玩家看到你播放例如“生气”之类的动作，从而打扰到其他原版玩家。\n\n推荐：“宽松”。
# Source: Strict
classic.settings.strict = 严格
# Source: Emotes have different turn behaviors when you target someone. Some emotes will make your torso turn (i.e: /hum), some only your head (i.e: /stepdance),some will only make your eyes follow your target (i.e: /beesknees) while others will not move at all (i.e:/guard).\n\n"Very strict" only picks emotes that behaves the same way.\n"Strict" allows eye following differences but keeps emotes head and body turn behaviors.\n"Lenient" allows any turn behavior.\n\nThe plugin will still always try to find the best match first, regardless of the selected rule.\n\nRecommended: "Lenient".
classic.settings.turn_matching.help = 当你选中他人时，情感动作的转向行为各不相同。有些会让你的上身转向（例如 /hum），有些只转动头部（例如 /stepdance），有些只用眼睛跟随目标（例如 /beesknees），还有些完全不动（例如 /guard）。\n\n“非常严格”只选择行为完全相同的情感动作。\n“严格”允许眼睛跟随的差异，但保留头部和身体的转向行为。\n“宽松”允许任何转向行为。\n\n无论选择哪条规则，插件都会优先尝试寻找最佳匹配。\n\n推荐：“宽松”。
# Source: Lets Direct Play bypass an emote in any pose.\n\nLeave it off unless you know what you are doing. When off, the plugin only plays emotes from states where nothing can be noticed.
classic.settings.unsafe.help = 允许直接播放在任何姿势下绕过情感动作。\n\n除非你清楚自己在做什么，否则请保持关闭。关闭时，插件只会在不会被察觉的状态下播放情感动作。
# Source: In practice it is a non-issue. This has been a thing in other tools and plugins (and still is in some of them), which people have used for years without trouble. Go back to safe mode, or even better, to emote swap, if you are uncomfy with this.
classic.settings.unsafe.reassurance = 实际上这不是问题。其他工具和插件中也有过这种做法（其中一些至今仍然如此），人们已经使用多年都没有出现问题。如果你对此感到不安，请切回安全模式，或者更好的是，使用情感动作替换。
# Source: Very strict
classic.settings.very_strict = 非常严格
# Source: Shows a warning in chat when a swap happened, but not the way you would expect.
classic.settings.warning_messages.help = 当替换发生了、但方式与你的预期不同时，在聊天中显示警告。
# Source: How long the same warning stays quiet after you have seen it.\n\nAccepts time format: 5m, 300s, 5m10s, 1h.\nSet to 0 to disable.
classic.settings.warning_throttle.help = 你看到某个警告后，同一警告保持静默的时长。\n\n可接受的时间格式：5m、300s、5m10s、1h。\n设为 0 则停用。
# Source: Only when necessary
classic.settings.when_necessary = 仅在必要时
