# Source: Until now Bypass Emote forced the animation onto your character from your own client. Nothing was ever sent to the server, but in specific cases, where your character would be in any pose other than the base one, the game client would send duplicate change pose packets to the server. This is not caused by the plugin itself, but rather by how the game handles pose changes. The "Idle Animation Delay" setting in the game's Character Configuration > Control Settings > Character tab is what causes this.
prompt.before = 到目前为止，Bypass Emote 都是在你自己的客户端中把动画强制加到你的角色上。插件从未向服务器发送任何内容，但在某些特定情况下，当你的角色处于基础姿势以外的任何姿势时，游戏客户端会向服务器发送重复的更换姿势数据包。这并不是插件本身造成的，而是游戏处理姿势更换的方式所致。造成这一问题的是游戏“角色设置 > 操作设置 > 角色”页中的“待机动作延迟”设置。
# Source: You can change this at any time in the settings.
prompt.change_later = 你可以随时在设置中更改。
# Source: Keep Direct Play
prompt.direct_play = 保留直接播放
# Source: Use Emote Swap
prompt.emote_swap = 使用情感动作替换
# Source: A safer way to play locked emotes
prompt.heading = 一种更安全的播放未解锁情感动作的方式
# Source: The new mode uses Penumbra to swap locked emotes onto unlocked ones. The game plays the emote itself. Nothing mismatches between the game and the server anymore.
