# Source: "Multiple" keeps multiple swaps active at the same time in the mod.\n"One at a time" turns the previous swaps off as soon as a new one starts.\n\nRecommended: "Multiple".
silk.settings.behavior.help = “多个”在模组中同时保持多个替换生效。\n“一次一个”在新的替换开始时立即关闭之前的替换。\n\n推荐：“多个”。
# Source: Blocked
silk.settings.blocked = 屏蔽
# Source: Leave this on. Bypassing several animations in a row can look broken while it is off.
silk.settings.cached_dispatch.alarm = 请保持开启。关闭时，连续绕过多个动画可能看起来不正常。
# Source: Gives each bypassed emote a target emote of its own. Useful when you bypass several emotes quickly.\n\n"Off" redraws your character on every bypass.\n"When needed" spreads emotes only after a game patch breaks the cache-breaker.\n"On" always spreads emotes.\n\nRecommended: "On". "Off" is not recommended.
silk.settings.cached_dispatch.help = 为每个被绕过的情感动作分配一个专属的目标情感动作。在你快速绕过多个情感动作时很有用。\n\n“关闭”每次绕过都会重绘你的角色。\n“必要时”只在游戏版本更新导致缓存破坏失效后才分散情感动作。\n“开启”始终分散情感动作。\n\n推荐：“开启”。不推荐“关闭”。
# Source: Applies the cache-break mechanism to every emote, even the ones you own. An animation change then applies without a redraw and without stopping the emote. Experimental.
silk.settings.cache_break.help = 对所有情感动作应用缓存破坏机制，包括你已拥有的。这样动画更改无需重绘、也无需停止情感动作即可生效。实验性功能。
# Source: The old version.
silk.settings.classic_interface.text = 与以前版本完全相同的窗口。
# Source: Compact rows
silk.settings.compact_rows = 紧凑行
# Source: Much smaller rows in the emote list, to see more emotes at once.
silk.settings.compact_rows.help = 情感动作列表中的行会小很多，可以同时看到更多情感动作。
# Source: Which emotes a source emote may spread over. Takes effect while "Spread swaps over several emotes" is on. A rank is a group of emotes with the same characteristics (turn behaviour and so on).\n\n"Same rank" only picks targets of the same rank.\n"One below" also accepts targets one rank below.\n"Any" picks any target it can find.\n\nNone of them breaks your other rules.\n\nRecommended: "One below". Pick "Same rank" for behaviour accuracy.
silk.settings.dispatch_fidelity.help = 一个源情感动作可以分散到哪些情感动作上。在“将替换分散到多个情感动作”开启时生效。等级是一组特征相同的情感动作（转向行为等）。\n\n“同一等级”只选择同一等级的目标。\n“低一级”也接受低一个等级的目标。\n“任意”会选择它能找到的任何目标。\n\n它们都不会破坏你的其他规则。\n\n推荐：“低一级”。想要行为准确时可选“同一等级”。
# Source: How long the same error stays quiet after you have seen it.\n\nSet to 0 to see every one of them.
silk.settings.error_throttle.help = 你看到某个错误后，同一错误保持静默的时长。\n\n设为 0 则每次都显示。
# Source: When no unlocked looped emote fits as a target, your current idle pose can carry the emote instead. Using the pose redraws your character.\n\n"Never" blocks idle poses as targets.\n"If nothing fits" uses the pose only when no unlocked looped emote could have played at all. An emote you blocked yourself still counts as one that could have played.\n"Allow" falls back to your idle pose whenever nothing else is available.\n\nRecommended: "If nothing fits".
silk.settings.idle_pose_loops.help = 当没有合适的已解锁循环情感动作可作为目标时，你当前的待机姿势可以代为承载情感动作。使用姿势会重绘你的角色。\n\n“从不”禁止把待机姿势用作目标。\n“无其他选项时”只在确实没有任何已解锁的循环情感动作可以播放时才使用姿势。你自己屏蔽的情感动作仍算作本可以播放的情感动作。\n“允许”在没有其他可用选项时总会退回到你的待机姿势。\n\n推荐：“无其他选项时”。
# Source: If nothing fits
silk.settings.if_nothing_fits = 无其他选项时
# Source: How many swaps are kept per target emote. 0 keeps them all.\n\nA kept swap stays as an option of the generated Penumbra mod. Playing that emote again enables it without rebuilding the mod. Kept swaps make the mod bigger.
silk.settings.kept_swaps.help = 每个目标情感动作保留多少个替换。0 表示全部保留。\n\n保留的替换会作为生成的 Penumbra 模组中的一个选项。再次播放该情感动作时会直接启用它，无需重建模组。保留的替换会让模组变大。
# Source: Last resort
silk.settings.last_resort = 最后手段
# Source: Lenient
silk.settings.lenient = 宽松
# Source: "When it ends" puts your real emote back as soon as the animation stops.\n"On the target" keeps the swap enabled until the next time you play the target emote.\n"Never" keeps the swap live until another swap claims the same target emote.\n\n"When it ends" redraws your character after every swap.\n\nRecommended: "On the target".
silk.settings.lifetime.help = “结束时”在动画停止后立即恢复你真正的情感动作。\n“播放目标时”会保持替换，直到你下一次播放目标情感动作。\n“从不”会保持替换，直到另一个替换占用同一个目标情感动作。\n\n“结束时”会在每次替换后重绘你的角色。\n\n推荐：“播放目标时”。
# Source: Show locked emotes in the game emote window
silk.settings.locked_in_window = 在游戏情感动作窗口中显示未解锁的情感动作
# Source: "Strict" only puts a looping emote on another looping one.\n"Lenient" lets a looping emote play once on a one time emote when no better match exists.\n\nRecommended: "Strict". Pick "Lenient" when you own few emotes.
silk.settings.loop_matching.help = “严格”只会把循环情感动作放到另一个循环情感动作上。\n“宽松”在没有更好的匹配时，允许循环情感动作在只播放一次的情感动作上播放一次。\n\n推荐：“严格”。拥有的情感动作较少时可选“宽松”。
# Source: Adopt Malou, the orange cat
silk.settings.malou = 领养橘猫 Malou
# Source: He's really cute.
silk.settings.malou.help = 它真的很可爱。
# Source: Whether an unlocked emote that one of your mods changes may be used as a target. Other players can see that modded emote for a moment before the swap takes place.\n\n"Allowed" uses them freely.\n"Last resort" uses one only when nothing else fits.\n"Blocked" never uses one. The chat error then offers to disable the mod or open it in Penumbra.\n\nRecommended: "Last resort". Pick "Blocked" to keep your modded emotes out of sight.
silk.settings.modded_targets.help = 被你的某个模组修改过的已解锁情感动作能否用作目标。在替换生效之前，其他玩家可能会短暂看到那个被修改的情感动作。\n\n“允许”自由使用它们。\n“最后手段”只在没有其他合适选项时才使用。\n“屏蔽”永不使用，聊天中的错误消息会提供停用模组或在 Penumbra 中打开它的选项。\n\n推荐：“最后手段”。想让你的模组情感动作不被看到时可选“屏蔽”。
# Source: Multiple
silk.settings.multiple = 多个
# Source: Never
silk.settings.never = 从不
# Source: The one you are looking at.
silk.settings.new_interface.text = 就是你现在看到的这个。
# Source: Off
silk.settings.off = 关闭
# Source: On
silk.settings.on = 开启
# Source: One at a time
silk.settings.one_at_a_time = 一次一个
# Source: One below
silk.settings.one_below = 低一级
# Source: On the target
silk.settings.on_the_target = 播放目标时
# Source: Enable preview popup
silk.settings.preview_popup = 启用预览弹窗
# Source: On: clicking an emote opens a panel next to the window, and a double-click plays it. In Emote Swap the panel also previews the swap. Off: no panel, a single click plays the emote.
silk.settings.preview_popup.help = 开启：点击情感动作会在窗口旁打开一个面板，双击则播放。在情感动作替换模式下，面板还会预览替换结果。关闭：没有面板，单击即播放情感动作。
# Source: Recommended
silk.settings.recommended = 推荐
# Source: Safe mode is not a guarantee either. It keeps Direct Play out of the states where it was proved to go wrong. Emote Swap is the safe option and behaves almost the same way.
silk.settings.safe_mode_not_a_promise = 安全模式也不是保证。它会让直接播放避开已被证实会出问题的状态。情感动作替换才是安全的选项，而且表现几乎相同。
# Source: Same rank
silk.settings.same_rank = 同一等级
# Source: Emote list
silk.settings.section.emote_list = 情感动作列表
# Source: "Strict" never puts an emote on one that makes sound.\n"Lenient" allows matching emotes that make sounds together.\n"Off" plays emotes regardless of sound.\n\nSound matching keeps other players from hearing an emote you did not play.\n\nRecommended: "Lenient".
silk.settings.sound_matching.help = “严格”永远不会把情感动作放到会发出声音的情感动作上。\n“宽松”允许把都会发出声音的情感动作相互匹配。\n“关闭”无论声音如何都会播放情感动作。\n\n声音匹配可以避免其他玩家听到你并没有播放的情感动作。\n\n推荐：“宽松”。
# Source: Strict
silk.settings.strict = 严格
# Source: Emotes turn your character differently when you have a target. Some turn the torso (/hum). Some turn only the head (/stepdance). Some only move the eyes (/beesknees). Some do not move at all (/guard).\n\n"Very strict" only picks emotes that behave the same way.\n"Strict" keeps the head and body turn, and allows a different eye behaviour.\n"Lenient" allows any turn behaviour.\n\nThe best match is always tried first.\n\nRecommended: "Lenient".
silk.settings.turn_matching.help = 当你有目标时，不同情感动作让角色转向的方式不同。有些转动上身（/hum），有些只转动头部（/stepdance），有些只移动眼睛（/beesknees），有些完全不动（/guard）。\n\n“非常严格”只选择行为相同的情感动作。\n“严格”保留头部和身体的转向，允许眼睛行为不同。\n“宽松”允许任何转向行为。\n\n总会优先尝试最佳匹配。\n\n推荐：“宽松”。
# Source: Lets Direct Play bypass an emote in any pose.\n\nLeave it off unless you know what you are doing. When it is off, the plugin only plays emotes from states where nothing can be noticed.
silk.settings.unsafe.help = 允许直接播放在任何姿势下绕过情感动作。\n\n除非你清楚自己在做什么，否则请保持关闭。关闭时，插件只会在不会被察觉的状态下播放情感动作。
# Source: In practice it is a non-issue. Other tools and plugins have done this for years without trouble. Go back to safe mode, or to Emote Swap, if you are uncomfortable with it.
silk.settings.unsafe.reassurance = 实际上这不是问题。其他工具和插件多年来一直这样做，没有出现问题。如果你对此感到不安，请切回安全模式或情感动作替换。
# Source: Very strict
silk.settings.very_strict = 非常严格
# Source: Shows a warning in chat when a swap did not happen the way you would expect.
silk.settings.warning_messages.help = 当替换没有按你预期的方式发生时，在聊天中显示警告。
# Source: How long the same warning stays quiet after you have seen it.\n\nSet to 0 to disable.
silk.settings.warning_throttle.help = 你看到某个警告后，同一警告保持静默的时长。\n\n设为 0 则停用。
